{"id":"91aa38d1fd431425","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-modal-kripke-model.md","title":"Modal Kripke semantics","display":"df-modal-kripke-model — Modal Kripke semantics","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-modal-kripke-model","aliases":["72-df-modal-kripke-model"],"display":"df-modal-kripke-model — Modal Kripke semantics","depends_on":["[[72-df-modal-formula]]"],"source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9","source_location":"Chapter VII, Definition 2.2(a)-(c),(e), printed p. 478, PDF p. 490","source_statement_checked":true,"proof_status":"not-applicable-definition","source_proof_status":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"round2_verification_status":"definition-contract-checked","verification_status":"definition-contract-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-modal-kripke-model"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-modal-kripke-model</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-kripke-model — Modal Kripke semantics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Elsevier, 1998, ISBN 0-444-89840-9"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Chapter VII, Definition 2.2(a)-(c),(e), printed p. 478, PDF p. 490"},{"key":"source_statement_checked","html":"true"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"not-applicable-definition; local well-definedness and referenced interfaces checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"round2_verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"definition-contract-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"94fb82dfe6146007\" href=\"?note=94fb82dfe6146007\" title=\"72-df-modal-formula\">72-df-modal-formula</a> 的模态语法。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(W\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq W\\times W\">\\(R\\subseteq W\\times W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,w\\in W\">\\(u,v,w\\in W\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"⟦\\cdot⟧_{\\mathcal M}:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(⟦\\cdot⟧_{\\mathcal M}:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span> 由以下递归引入。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}\">\\(\\operatorname{GLFrame}\\)</span> 是所引入的框架谓词；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Vdash_m\">\\(\\Vdash_m\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models_m\">\\(\\models_m\\)</span> 是元语言中的满足关系。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\land\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u,v,w\\in W\\;((R(u,v)\\land R(v,w))\\Rightarrow R(u,w))\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall X\\subseteq W\\;(X\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists u\\in X\\;\\forall v\\in X\\;\\neg R(u,v)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\land\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u,v,w\\in W\\;((R(u,v)\\land R(v,w))\\Rightarrow R(u,w))\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall X\\subseteq W\\;(X\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists u\\in X\\;\\forall v\\in X\\;\\neg R(u,v)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦ p_i⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq V(i),\\qquad\n⟦\\bot_m⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n⟦ A\\to_m B⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\n(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{\\mathcal M},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦ p_i⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq V(i),\\qquad\n⟦\\bot_m⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n⟦ A\\to_m B⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\n(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{\\mathcal M},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"⟦\\Box_m A⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in W:\\forall v\\in W\\;(R(w,v)\\Rightarrow v\\in⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M})\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ w\\in⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M\\models_m A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M}=W.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[⟦\\Box_m A⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in W:\\forall v\\in W\\;(R(w,v)\\Rightarrow v\\in⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M})\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ w\\in⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M\\models_m A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M}=W.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书要求 L 的框架具有传递关系且逆关系良基。这里以每个非空子集都有 R 极大元表述逆良基性，可直接用于 Löb 公理的可靠性证明。满足关系对有限语法树作递归，唯一且全定义。本定义采用逐世界的经典命题求值；现存 Kripke-content 原子给出沿序持久的直觉主义内容集，签名和语义均不同，因此没有将其复用为本定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-modal-formula","status":"resolved","id":"94fb82dfe6146007","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[72-df-modal-formula]] 的模态语法。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"W\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq W\\times W","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"u,v,w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_m","display":false},{"tex":"⟦\\cdot⟧_{\\mathcal M}:\\mathcal F_m\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Vdash_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\models_m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\nW\\ne\\varnothing\\ \\land\\ R\\subseteq W\\times W\\ \\land\\\n\\forall u,v,w\\in W\\;((R(u,v)\\land R(v,w))\\Rightarrow R(u,w))\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall X\\subseteq W\\;(X\\ne\\varnothing\\Rightarrow\\exists u\\in X\\;\\forall v\\in X\\;\\neg R(u,v)).","display":true},{"tex":"⟦ p_i⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq V(i),\\qquad\n⟦\\bot_m⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\\varnothing,\\qquad\n⟦ A\\to_m B⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\n(W\\setminus⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M})\\cup⟦ B⟧_{\\mathcal M},","display":true},{"tex":"⟦\\Box_m A⟧_{\\mathcal M}\\coloneqq\n\\{w\\in W:\\forall v\\in W\\;(R(w,v)\\Rightarrow v\\in⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M})\\},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M,w\\Vdash_m A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ w\\in⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M},\\qquad\n\\mathcal M\\models_m A\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ ⟦ A⟧_{\\mathcal M}=W.","display":true}],"bytes":2471,"backlinks":[{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[72-df-modal-kripke-model|df-modal-kripke-model — Modal Kripke semantics]]"},{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-232","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-df-modal-kripke-model|df-modal-kripke-model — Modal Kripke semantics]]"},{"id":"d40b90e274cadbda","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"588ba1ca83000a13","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$W\\ne\\varnothing$、$R\\subseteq W^2$、$V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)$，$\\mathcal M=\\langle W,R,V\\rangle$；$\\operatorname{GLFrame}(W,R)$ 以及 $\\models_m$ 见 [[72-df-modal-kripke-model]]。"}],"outgoing":["94fb82dfe6146007"]}